		{"id":"docs-node","type":"text","x":1295,"y":150,"width":280,"height":130,"text":"### docs/ — Documentation\n\n• README.md — Quick start\n• ARCHITECTURE.md — System design\n• COMPLETE_OVERVIEW.md — Full blueprint\n• SETUP_GUIDE.md — Installation\n• OPERATIONAL_HANDBOOK.md — Daily use\n• CLI_COMMANDS.md — Command reference\n• MEMORY_SYSTEMS.md, DATA_FLOWS.md,\n  INTEGRATIONS.md, REPORTING.md,\n  LOGGING.md, ORCHESTRATION.md,\n  QUALITY_ASSURANCE.md, LEARNING_LAYER.md\n• setup/ — Automation setup\n• workflows/ — Intake workflows","color":"3"},
		{"id":"intake-node","type":"text","x":1295,"y":300,"width":280,"height":100,"text":"### intake/ — Auto-Processing\n\n**watcher.py** — macOS launchd service\n  monitors staging/ every 10s\n\n**process_intake.py** — Routes files\n  by filename, tags, and frontmatter\n\n→ Zero-touch file import pipeline","color":"4"},
		{"id":"storage-node","type":"text","x":1295,"y":420,"width":280,"height":100,"text":"### Storage Layer\n\n**agent_memory.db** (SQLite)\n  MCP memory — facts, lessons, events\n  WAL mode, indexed, ACID\n\n**memories.db / self.db / tasks.db / knowledge.db**\n  (defined in ARCHITECTURE.md, initialized\n  on engine startup)","color":"5"},
		{"id":"vault-node","type":"text","x":1295,"y":540,"width":280,"height":60,"text":"**vault/** — Secrets (git-ignored)\ncredentials/, accounts/, auth/","color":"2"},
		{"id":"mcp-servers-node","type":"text","x":1295,"y":615,"width":280,"height":50,"text":"**mcp-servers/mail-mcp/**\nExternal email MCP server (Python)","color":"1"}
	],
